      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This is an opening prayer offered by Rabbi Dr. Isaac Mayer Wise, before an address by Lajos Kossuth (1802-1894) sponsored by the Young Men’s Hungarian Liberty Association in Albany, New York on 5 June 1852. The prayer was published as part of the “Programme of Exercises,” in <tei:hi rend="italic">The Asmonean</tei:hi> (12 June 1852).</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
